(1)(a) companionship; and
(1)(b)
(1)(b)(i) a salary;
(1)(b)(ii) a fee;
(1)(b)(iii) a commission;
(1)(b)(iv) hire;
(1)(b)(v) profit; or
(1)(b)(vi) any amount similar to an amount listed in this Subsection (1)(b).
(2) "Escort service" means any person who furnishes or arranges for an escort to accompany another individual for:
(2)(a) companionship; and
(2)(b)
(2)(b)(i) a salary;
(2)(b)(ii) a fee;
(2)(b)(iii) a commission;
(2)(b)(iv) hire;
(2)(b)(v) profit; or
