(2)(b)(vii)(A) if applicable, a political subdivision lien for road damage that a railroad company causes, as described in Section 10-7-30;
(2)(b)(vii)(B) if applicable, a political subdivision lien for municipal water distribution, as described in Section 10-8-17, or a political subdivision lien for an increase in supply from a municipal water distribution, as described in Section 10-8-19;
